{"title": "Deadly Derivation", "pageid": 28495, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deadly_Derivation", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Deadly Derivation</b> is a passive feature that heals the wearer a little when they poison a foe.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poison</a> a foe, heal yourself for <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\">Derivation Cloak</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>There are four <b>Poisoned</b> conditions reusing the same icon, which can be confusing. The most general one is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a>, and it's the only one considered by this passive. That means there will be no healing via the following similar conditions:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Basic_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Basic Poison) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Basic_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Basic Poison) (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> condition caused by a weapon coated in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\">Basic Poison</a>. But the same item when thrown generates a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Cloud\" title=\"Poison Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Cloud\" title=\"Poison Cloud\">Poison Cloud</a>, which can cause the correct Poisoned condition, triggering this passive.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Suspicious_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Suspicious Poison) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Suspicious_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Suspicious Poison) (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> condition caused by drinking or throwing <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspicious_Poison\" title=\"Suspicious Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Suspicious_Poison\" title=\"Suspicious Poison\">Suspicious Poison</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Spider_Meat)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Spider Meat) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Spider_Meat)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Spider Meat) (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> condition caused by consuming <a href=\"/wiki/Spider_meat\" title=\"Spider meat\">Spider meat</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This passive has great synergy when combined with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoner%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Poisoner's Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoner%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Poisoner's Gloves\">Poisoner's Gloves</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broodmother%27s_Revenge\" title=\"Broodmother's Revenge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broodmother%27s_Revenge\" title=\"Broodmother's Revenge\">Broodmother's Revenge</a>. Every attack can cause <b>Poisoned</b>, healing the character and refreshing the poison coating.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195803\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4098/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37847/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16074/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.050/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 989542/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransc